{"id":"izobretenie","lemma":"изобретение","pos":"noun","rank":4252,"glosses":["invention"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a5/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"изобретения","plural":"изобретения"},"examples":[{"text":"Его изобретение заслуживает внимания.","en":"His invention deserves attention.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},null,null,{"g":"attention","l":"внимание"}]},{"text":"Компьютер — это недавнее изобретение.","en":"The computer is a recent invention.","words":[{"g":"computer"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null]},{"text":"Позвольте продемонстрировать моё изобретение.","en":"Allow me to demonstrate my invention to you.","words":[{"g":"to allow, to permit","l":"позволить"},{"g":"to demonstrate"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Как люди точили карандаши до изобретения точилки?","en":"How did people sharpen their pencils before the invention of the pencil sharpener?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"people, humans"},null,{"g":"pencil","l":"карандаш"},{"g":"until / before"},null,null]},{"text":"Калькулятор - чудесное изобретение.","en":"The calculator is a wonderful invention.","words":[{"g":"calculator"},{"g":"wonderful, miraculous","l":"чудесный"},null]}]}